o<on_abort> sub
; Runs on every abort ([RS274NGC]ON_ABORT_COMMAND). An (abort,...) flushes
; any M64/M65 queued just before it, so ATC clean-up must happen here.
; Deliberately left alone: P3 ambo (stays on so the arm can be eased by hand)
; and P4 unclamp (re-clamping while the arm holds a tool could fight the arm).
M65 P0                  ; carousel disable (lets carousel.comp return to idle)
M65 P1                  ; shotbolt engaged
M65 P2                  ; arm motor off
M65 P7                  ; air blast off
; Unhome the carousel (P6 rising edge): an abort mid-move leaves the magazine
; between pockets, so the next carousel move re-homes first.
M64 P6
G4 P0.05
M65 P6
o<on_abort> endsub
M2
